# 🛡️ AI Platform Privacy Architecture
**Compare: Poe • ChatGPT • Claude • Gemini • Perplexity**

## 📊 Architecture Overview
### 🟢 Poe — Isolated Shield
- ✅ **Multi-Shield**: Separate data domain per model/bot
- ✅ **Full/Half Shield**: Clear icon warning
- ✅ **No cross-model leakage**
- ✅ **No training on official models**

### 🔵 ChatGPT — Centralized Monolith
- ❌ Single shared domain
- ❌ No isolation between models/GPTs
- ⚠️ Unclear boundaries

### 🟣 Claude/Gemini/Perplexity — Closed Silos
- ✅ Secure
- ❌ Limited/no 3rd-party bots
- ❌ Locked ecosystem

## 📈 Privacy vs Flexibility
> **Poe = Best Balance** — High Privacy + Multi-Model Flexibility

